## Initial Q&A
### Did Maskoor Usmani, as a candidate of the Indian National Congress party, physically install a portrait of Muhammad Ali Jinnah on the campus of Aligarh Muslim University?
Answer: Based on the provided source, the claim that Maskoor Usmani installed Jinnah's portrait at AMU is false. The portrait has been on the wall since the pre-independence era, as "Jinnah was accorded life membership of the AMU students' union in 1938," and the university administration has clarified that the portrait has been in the students' hall since that time, not installed by Usmani.

